category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libgtest-devel
sdesc: "C++ library for the efficient evaluation of integrals over effective core potentials (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "Libecpint is a C++ library for the efficient evaluation of integrals over ab
initio effective core potentials, using a mixture of generated, recursive code
and Gauss-Chebyshev quadrature. It is designed to be standalone and generic,
and is now in its first stable release."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/robashaw/libecpint
license: MIT
